SlotNameInvalid {
    at    Source/DreamShaderCompiler/Private/Pass/DreamShaderPassSlotRegistry.cpp
    src   "'{0}' cannot name something in an HLSL slot: a slot name has to be an identifier, and one starting with DP_ would hide one of the slot's fixed parameters."
    text  "'{0}' 不能用作 HLSL 槽位中的名称：槽位中的名称必须是标识符，而以 DP_ 开头的名称会遮蔽槽位的某个固定参数。"
    state machine
}

SlotNameTwice {
    at    Source/DreamShaderCompiler/Private/Pass/DreamShaderPassSlotRegistry.cpp
    src   "'{0}' would be defined twice in the pass's HLSL slot: every read, write and param needs its own name, and the slot also names a read's size and UV rect <Name>Size and <Name>UVRect, and a write's size <Name>Size, which must not meet another name either."
    text  "'{0}' 会在该 Pass 的 HLSL 槽位中被定义两次：每个 read、write 和 param 都需要自己的名称；此外，槽位还会把 read 的尺寸和 UV 矩形命名为 <Name>Size 和 <Name>UVRect，把 write 的尺寸命名为 <Name>Size，这些名称同样不能与其他名称重复。"
    state machine
}

